{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/669321-chronicle-idea-r-i-p-d-ish","id":669321,"title":"Chronicle Idea: R.I.P.D.-ish?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Geist: The Sin-Eaters"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-18T01:17:54-07:00","id":669321,"title":"Chronicle Idea: R.I.P.D.-ish?","content":"So, I was watching (well, listening too) R.I.P.D and-WAIT! Don't leave yet! I know it was a bad movie (well, it was fun but bad), so most people are quick to dismiss it as a M.I.B. ripoff (which it totally is), but that doesn't change the fact that a Geist game with some of the Agency elements would be fun! Here's my thought:<br /> <br /> Instead of going after Ghosts, or rather instead of JUST Ghosts, they would hunt down everyone that's trying to cheat Death. Vampires, Mummies, Immortals, Mages that try and extend their lives, etc., those that should never have lived, Prometheans, Demons, etc. and then maybe some of the others, the ones that are part spirit themselves, can be the &quot;Cops&quot; of their own beat, i.e. Werewolves police Spirits of Nature, Possessed police the Demon beat, etc. They cross over sometimes, like with the Demons or with a Nature Spirit of Death. <br /> <br /> Anyway, that's the idea. They work for an agency. If I were to run it, which I may, I'd be REALLY tempted to use the basic outline of Orpheus, so you know how that would go! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Thoughts?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1101-blindst","name":"blindST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T01:54:20-07:00","id":669344,"title":"","content":"[QUOTE=blindST;n669321, or rather instead of JUST Ghosts, they would hunt down everyone that's trying to cheat Death. Vampires, Mummies, Immortals, Mages that try and extend their lives, etc., those that should never have lived, Prometheans, Demons, etc<br /> [/QUOTE]<br /> <br /> I thought that was Abmortals<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T22:28:30-07:00","id":670488,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/669321-chronicle-idea-r-i-p-d-ish?p=669344#post669344\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I thought that was Abmortals</div> </div> </div> </div>Abmortals would probably also fit there, yes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-19T00:48:19-07:00","id":670550,"title":"","content":"Sure! Abnormals can go on the chopping block too! More the merrier. After I posted I thought of this too: What if the different part spirit groups are just different divisions of the same Agency? I could make Angels the head of the Agency or at least the talking heads of it. Also, I think I'd use part of the Hunter stuff. In specific, Advanced Armory would be cool, maybe Relics and Thaumatechnology, though I could see using both of those as something the &quot;Rival Agency&quot; uses. Maybe two Rival Agencies? The one using Thaumatechnology could be a private sector firm. Just some thoughts. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1101-blindst","name":"blindST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}